  "title": "Spicy Tofu Tacos with Mango Mayonnaise",
  "description": "The beauty of Summer in Australia lies in the accessibility and convenience of swimming all day and watching the sunset, drink in hand, small convenient snack meal in the other. Nothing fits this brief more than a taco - with crispy tofu inside no less! The real star of this dish is the mayonnaise from Roza’s. There’s a hint of sweet mango amidst the expected tang of mayonnaise we all know and love. Douse these tacos in a good squeeze of lime and you’ll be in for a sweet ride.",
